SimulationType                MonteCarlo
NumberOfCycles                5000
NumberOfInitializationCycles  1000
PrintEvery                    1000

Forcefield                    local
ChargeMethod                  Ewald
EwaldPrecision                1e-6
CutOffVDW                     12.8
CutOffCoulomb                 12.8
RemoveAtomNumberCodeFromLabel yes

ComputeNumberOfMoleculesHistogram yes
WriteNumberOfMoleculesHistogramEvery 5000
NumberOfMoleculesRange        10
NumberOfMoleculesHistogramSize 50

Framework 0
FrameworkName framework
UnitCells 2 2 1
HeliumVoidFraction 0.877
ExternalTemperature 298.0
ExternalPressure 1e3 5e3 1e4 5e4 1e5

Component 0 MoleculeName       n-heptane
            MoleculeDefinition local
            IdealGasRosenbluthWeight 0.0004450
            SwapProbability 1.0
            CreateNumberOfMolecules 0

Component 1 MoleculeName       n-hexane
            MoleculeDefinition local
            IdealGasRosenbluthWeight 0.0029442
            SwapProbability 1.0
            CreateNumberOfMolecules 0

